{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>And the spreading of his wings will fill the breadth of your land, O Immanu El.</b> The reason he mentioned it is that it was a sign that Jerusalem would be delivered from the hand of Rezin and Pekah, and also from the hand of Sennacherib, also as he exiled Damascus and Samaria.</b>"], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {0 "The bracketed note [צ\"ל ושמרון] indicates the text should read 'and Samaria'; translated accordingly."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:52:51.136419153Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}